.TH fedorajam-pwjack-config 1 "24 January 2026" "1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fedorajam-pwjack-config \- Configure PipeWire\-JACK settings (buffersize samplerate)
.SH SYNOPSIS
fedorajam-pwjack-config BUFFERSIZE SAMPLERATE
.SH DESCRIPTION
fedorajam-pwjack-config writes a small profile file to /etc/profile.d to set
PipeWire quantum and sample rate for low-latency JACK-style setups.

BUFFERSIZE must be one of: 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024, 2048, 4096.
SAMPLERATE must be one of: 22050, 32000, 44100, 48000, 88200, 96000, 192000.

On success the tool writes /etc/profile.d/fedorajam-pwjack.sh and advises the user to
log out and back in for the change to take effect.
.SH EXAMPLES
fedorajam-pwjack-config 1024 48000
.SH SEE ALSO
fedorajam-audio-config(1)
